#
# Semantic content of the header page: values, relations and properties.
# The presence of each name and type comes with the Tier 0 generator.

assertion  XBD.uchar.h.001
anchor     basedefs/uchar.h.html#DESCRIPTION/char16_t
class      required
since      2024
says       char16_t is the same type as uint_least16_t and char32_t is the same
           type as uint_least32_t.
test       t/001-char-types.c
nomutant   compile-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants

assertion  XBD.uchar.h.002
anchor     basedefs/uchar.h.html#DESCRIPTION/mbstate_t
class      required
since      2024
says       <uchar.h> defines the types mbstate_t, size_t.
test       t/002-types-base.c
nomutant   compile-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants

assertion  XBD.uchar.h.003
anchor     basedefs/uchar.h.html#DESCRIPTION/c16rtomb
class      required
since      2024
says       <uchar.h> declares c16rtomb(), c32rtomb(), mbrtoc16(),
           mbrtoc32() with the prototypes the page gives.
test       t/003-functions.c
nomutant   compile-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants
